menu "DriveLink main"

    config DRIVELINK_STACK_LOG_PERIOD_S
        int "Task stack high-water log period (s)"
        default 30
        range 0 3600
        help
            While app_main idles, log the smallest free stack (high-water
            mark, in bytes) of each firmware task this often. 0 turns the
            log off. Used to size task stacks. Compiled out when
            DIAG_CONSOLE_LOG is off (no console text).

endmenu
